<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How cannedlatte.com makes money.">
  <h1>How this site makes money</h1>
  <p>Some "buy" links are affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, the retailer or brand pays us a small commission. It costs you nothing extra.</p>
  <p>Commissions never affect which products we list, the specs we publish, or how the rankings sort. Rankings are generated from label data, and a brand cannot pay to move up. Brands can pay for a clearly labeled "featured" placement, which is always marked as such.</p>
  <p>We also run display ads and sell stickers and shirts. Questions: hello@cannedlatte.com.</p>
</Base>
